6#issuecomment-3687430623","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111656","id":3687430623,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bybnf","user":{"login":"leftbones","id":77086654,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MDg2NjU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77086654?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leftbones","html_url":"https://github.com/leftbones","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leftbones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leftbones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leftbones/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leftbones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leftbones/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leftbones/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leftbones/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leftbones/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leftbones/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-23T17:29:49Z","updated_at":"2025-12-23T17:29:49Z","body":"I was able to reproduce this on an empty project with the [Godot Minimal Theme](https://github.com/passivestar/godot-minimal-theme) set as the custom theme in the project settings. Nothing but an empty Control node as the main scene.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3687430623/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]